	["Size of minimap icons like gathering nodes and tracking."] = "采集点、追踪等小地图图标的大小。",
	["Interactive radar"] = "雷达可交互",
	["Lets the radar take clicks and the mouse wheel. When off, clicks go to the map. Hovering a node shows what it is either way."] = "让雷达响应点击和鼠标滚轮。关闭时点击会作用于地图。无论开关，鼠标指向采集点都会显示它是什么。",
	["Hide GoodMap's player arrow"] = "隐藏 GoodMap 的玩家箭头",
