	["Show the radar in cities and inns"] = "在城市和旅店显示雷达",
	["In cities the minimap can show a gray square where its terrain would be. When this is off, the radar sits out while you're resting."] = "在城市里，小地图可能会在地形位置显示一个灰色方块。关闭后，休息时雷达会暂时退出。",
	["Show the radar indoors"] = "在室内显示雷达",
