	["Show group members' pings in the world"] = "在世界中显示队友的信号",
	["A group member's ping becomes your map pin, so you see it in the world with the distance to it. It replaces your own map pin."] = "队友的信号会变成你的地图标记，你能在世界中看到它和距离。它会替换你自己的地图标记。",
	["Double-click to ping"] = "双击发信号",
