	["Double right-click for a raid marker"] = "右键双击放置团队标记",
	["Double right-click the map to drop a raid marker: the red X unless you pick another below. Once a marker is down, a double right-click asks which one you want."] = "右键双击地图放置团队标记：默认是红色叉，也可以在下方另选。地图上已有标记时，右键双击会询问你要放哪一个。",
	["Put your pings and markers in the world"] = "在世界中显示你的信号和标记",
