	["Share in chat"] = "在聊天中分享",
	["Also posts a map pin link in your group's chat, or in /say when you're not in a group. Players without GoodMap can click it to see the spot on their map and in the world."] = "同时在队伍聊天中发送地图标记链接；不在队伍中时发送到 /说。没有 GoodMap 的玩家点击链接，就能在自己的地图和世界中看到这个位置。",
	["The mark key places"] = "标记键放置",
	["Hold the mark key and click the map. Everyone in your group who uses GoodMap sees it. Add-ons can't put markers in the world itself, so they show on the map."] = "按住标记键并点击地图。队伍中所有使用 GoodMap 的人都能看到。插件无法在游戏世界里放置标记，所以它们显示在地图上。",
