	["Markers"] = "标记",
	["Removes the markers on the map for everyone in your group. In a raid, only the leader and assistants can."] = "为整个队伍清除地图上的标记。在团队中，只有团长和助理可以这样做。",
	["Houses"] = "房屋",
	["Automatic uses GoodMap's floor plan, or the Blizzard minimap if another house map add-on (Chamberlain, HouseMinimap) is installed. No minimap hides both."] = "“自动”会使用 GoodMap 平面图；如果装了其他房屋地图插件（Chamberlain、HouseMinimap），则使用暴雪小地图。“不显示小地图”会把两者都隐藏。",
	["Complete rooms"] = "补全房间",
